{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:FluidDynamics.HelicityConservation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"FluidDynamics.HelicityConservation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Sqrt"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.reeb_linking_magnitude_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.reeb_linking_magnitude_bound","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L164-L182","doc":"**Reeb-derived categorical linking magnitude.**\nThe sub-ceiling magnitude `g` extracted via the Reeb-flow helicity for a\n2-strand `pn` bond obeys the eigenvalue bound `g < 1/√5`.\n\nThe `[HelicityContext]` binder this carried until 2026-08-31 was decorative —\nthe proof never used it, and the class it named is gone. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.helicity_conservation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.helicity_conservation","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L133-L162","doc":"**Categorical helicity conservation** ([`prop:helicity-conservation`]).\n\nLet `ℋ_q(t)` be given at every time by the md's definition over a fixed\nfilament family `fs` and mutual-linking term `mutualLk` (hypothesis `hdef`),\nand let each filament satisfy Călugăreanu–White–Fuller and the\nMoffatt–Ricca self-helicity identity.  Then\n\n* `ℋ_q` is **conserved** — md part (1); and\n* `ℋ_q = writhe + twist + linking` at every time — md part (2).\n\n**Both conjuncts are derived.**  Conservation is not a separate assumption:\nit follows from `ℋ_q(t)` being equal, at every `t`, to one time-independent\nexpression.  The decomposition is `selfSum_eq_writhe_add_twist`.\n\nWhat the hypotheses cost is stated in the module docstring: `hdef` is where\nthe quantum Euler equation would enter and is not established here, and the\ntwo per-filament identities are cited rather than proved. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:helicity-conservation","label":"prop:helicity-conservation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.selfSum_eq_writhe_add_twist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.selfSum_eq_writhe_add_twist","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L110-L131","doc":"**The writhe/twist split of the self-helicity term** (md part (2)).\n\nDerived, not assumed: summing `∮ = Lk·Γ²` and `Wr + Tw = Lk` over the\nfilaments gives `Σ ∮ = Σ Wr·Γ² + Σ Tw·Γ²`.  Both inputs are hypotheses on\ncaller-supplied filaments; neither is a field of anything, and the\nconclusion is neither. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.HelicityConserved","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.HelicityConserved","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L105-L108","doc":"**`ℋ_q` is conserved**: constant in time, the integrated form of\n`dℋ_q/dt = 0`.  Named here; establishing it for the quantum Euler flow is md\npart (1) and is not done in this development. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.twistTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.twistTerm","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L101-L103","doc":"The twist term `Σ_i Tw_q(ϱ_i)·(Γ_i^{(q)})²` of md part (2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.writheTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.writheTerm","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L97-L99","doc":"The writhe term `Σ_i Wr_q(ϱ_i)·(Γ_i^{(q)})²` of md part (2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.selfHelicitySum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.selfHelicitySum","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L92-L95","doc":"The self-helicity term `Σ_i ∮_{ϱ_i} v·ω ds` of the md's definition of\n`ℋ_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.SelfHelicityIsLinking","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.SelfHelicityIsLinking","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L86-L90","doc":"**Moffatt–Ricca self-helicity identity** `∮_ϱ v·ω ds = Lk_q(ϱ)·(Γ^{(q)})²`,\nas a proposition about one caller-supplied filament.  Not proved here. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.CWFHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.CWFHolds","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L79-L84","doc":"**Călugăreanu–White–Fuller relation** `Wr_q + Tw_q = Lk_q`, as a\nproposition about one caller-supplied filament.  Classical for the\nundeformed invariants; its `q`-deformation is asserted by the manuscript and\nis **not** proved here. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.selfHelicity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.selfHelicity","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L77-L77","doc":"Self-helicity `∮_ϱ v·ω ds` of this filament. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.Gamma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.Gamma","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L75-L75","doc":"Quantised circulation `Γ^{(q)} = [j]_q [j+1]_q` at intensity level `j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.Lk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.Lk","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L73-L73","doc":"`q`-deformed self-linking `Lk_q(ϱ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.Tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.Tw","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L71-L71","doc":"`q`-deformed twist `Tw_q(ϱ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.Wr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.Wr","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L69-L69","doc":"`q`-deformed writhe `Wr_q(ϱ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.FilamentHelicity","kind":"structure","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/helicity-conservation.lean#L64-L77","doc":"Helicity data of a single vortex filament `ϱ`: its `q`-deformed writhe,\ntwist and self-linking, its quantised circulation `Γ^{(q)} = [j]_q [j+1]_q`,\nand its self-helicity `∮_ϱ v·ω ds`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}